{
  "analysis": "I have created the comprehensive freestanding libc shim (libc_min.c) implementing all undefined symbols. Now I need to modify doomgeneric_img.c's __start to provide proper argc/argv with the WAD path, compile everything with -msoft-float to avoid FP instructions, link, check for unsupported instructions, and test on the VM.",
  "plan": "Modify doomgeneric_img.c's __start to pass argc=3 and argv with {\"doomgeneric\",\"-iwad\",\"/app/doom.wad\"}. Compile all sources plus libc_min.c with -msoft-float, link with -nostdlib and libgcc, check the resulting binary for unsupported instructions, and test with `node vm.js`.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "python3 - <<'PY'\nimport re\ns=open('doomgeneric_img.c').read()\nold='''void __start(void) __attribute__((section(\".text.startup\")));\nvoid __start(void) {\n  main(0, 0);\n  while (1);\n}'''\nnew='''static char prog_name[] = \"doomgeneric\";\nstatic char iwad_arg[] = \"-iwad\";\nstatic char wad_path[] = \"/app/doom.wad\";\nstatic char *argv_buf[4] = { prog_name, iwad_arg, wad_path, NULL };\n\nvoid __start(void) __attribute__((section(\".text.startup\")));\nvoid __start(void) {\n  main(3, argv_buf);\n  while (1);\n}'''\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen('doomgeneric_img.c','w').write(s)\nPY\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "tail -20 doomgeneric_img.c\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "rm -rf /tmp/dgobjs && mkdir -p /tmp/dgobjs\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "for f in libc_min.c am_map.c d_event.c d_items.c d_iwad.c d_loop.c d_main.c d_mode.c d_net.c doomdef.c doomgeneric.c doomgeneric_img.c doomstat.c dstrings.c dummy.c f_finale.c f_wipe.c g_game.c gusconf.c hu_lib.c hu_stuff.c i_cdmus.c i_endoom.c i_input.c i_joystick.c i_scale.c i_sound.c i_system.c i_timer.c i_video.c info.c m_argv.c m_bbox.c m_cheat.c m_config.c m_controls.c m_fixed.c m_menu.c m_misc.c m_random.c memio.c mus2mid.c p_ceilng.c p_doors.c p_enemy.c p_floor.c p_inter.c p_lights.c p_map.c p_maputl.c p_mobj.c p_plats.c p_pspr.c p_saveg.c p_setup.c p_sight.c p_spec.c p_switch.c p_telept.c p_tick.c p_user.c r_bsp.c r_data.c r_draw.c r_main.c r_plane.c r_segs.c r_sky.c r_things.c s_sound.c sha1.c sounds.c st_lib.c st_stuff.c statdump.c tables.c v_video.c w_checksum.c w_file.c w_file_stdc.c w_main.c w_wad.c wi_stuff.c z_zone.c; do mipsel-linux-gnu-gcc-12 -nostdlib -ffreestanding -static -march=mips1 -mfp32 -msoft-float -mno-mips16 -mno-interlink-mips16 -O1 -fno-asynchronous-unwind-tables -fno-unwind-tables -fPIC -fno-pic -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections -I. -c \"$f\" -o \"/tmp/dgobjs/${f%.c}.o\" 2>&1 || exit 1; done | head -120\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "mipsel-linux-gnu-gcc-12 -nostdlib -ffreestanding -static -march=mips1 -mfp32 -msoft-float -mno-mips16 -mno-interlink-mips16 -O1 -fno-asynchronous-unwind-tables -fno-unwind-tables -fPIC -fno-pic -ffunction-sections -fdata-sections -Wl,--gc-sections -Wl,-e,main -o /app/doomgeneric_mips /tmp/dgobjs/*.o /usr/lib/gcc-cross/mipsel-linux-gnu/12/libgcc.a 2>&1 | head -200\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
